=345 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notiz (CV\uff1aHiiragi Nana)</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122920/extras/b05efe2562c18e270b7bee36d01b3fc4.avif?t=1764313047\" width=614 height=345 /></span><br><br>The game is an economic simulation.<br>You must acquire resources through farming, logging, mining and other activities to develop your residence, <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122920/extras/4c9800735496ad66feacb0a3230ed1d4.poster.avif?t=1764313047\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122920/extras/4c9800735496ad66feacb0a3230ed1d4.webm?t=1764313047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122920/extras/4c9800735496ad66feacb0a3230ed1d4.mp4?t=1764313047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>and build relationships with the 5 main characters to add fun to your life and help you in your work.<br>Take care of their material needs, including sleep and food.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122920/extras/2630ea7ff715a4d00d0e718a3139f669.poster.avif?t=1764313047\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122920/extras/2630ea7ff715a4d00d0e718a3139f669.webm?t=1764313047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122920/extras/2630ea7ff715a4d00d0e718a3139f669.mp4?t=1764313047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And develop technology to get more types of resources.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http